    75→  freelang eval <code>      Evaluate FreeLang code
    76→  freelang ir <code>        Show IR for code (debug)
    77→  freelang test [path]      Run tests (Self-Testing Compiler)
    78→  freelang build <file>     Build program (use --test for test build)
    79→  freelang help             Show this help message
    80→  freelang version          Show version
    81→
    82→Options:
    83→  -v, --verbose             Show detailed output
    84→  --show-ir                 Display generated IR
